{"blt2b9505e1d54d0340":{"locale":"es","uid":"blt2b9505e1d54d0340","ACL":{},"_in_progress":false,"_version":2,"description":{"type":"doc","uid":"c5c81076b9c043c0b813ba8896b62338","_version":2,"attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"text":"Esta tienda de ropa ofrece una selección curada de prendas y accesorios de alta calidad diseñados para combinar tendencias contemporáneas con un estilo atemporal. Enfocada en piezas versátiles para cada ocasión, la tienda presenta una mezcla de esenciales cómodos para el día a día, atuendos profesionales sofisticados y destacados de temporada únicos. Con un compromiso con la artesanía de calidad y un ambiente acogedor, proporciona una experiencia de compra fluida para aquellos que buscan elevar su guardarropa personal con facilidad."}],"uid":"c4b7482570b7487096aa02071fb5b667"}]},"headline":"Ropa","image":{"uid":"am6159b1a9db62c1e2","created_at":"2026-09-15T09:22:12.938Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T09:22:12.938Z","created_by":"blt07c2db602bb1f752","updated_by":"blt07c2db602bb1f752","content_type":"image/png","file_size":"2050899","tags":[""],"filename":"Apparel.png","url":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt823327b57e39d857/am6159b1a9db62c1e2/bab54c7cace9e18ed8e4ac22/Apparel.png","ACL":{"fields":{}},"is_dir":false,"parent_uid":"am766f28dc127c4c03","_version":1,"title":"Apparel.png","description":"","publish_details":[{"environment":"blt981d8215e326a76c","locale":"en","time":"2026-09-15T09:23:23.737Z","user":"blt07c2db602bb1f752","version":1},{"environment":"bltc0c2e83d3b733728","locale":"en","time":"2026-09-15T09:23:23.737Z","user":"blt07c2db602bb1f752","version":1},{"environment":"bltfb5af98ff1412882","locale":"en","time":"2026-09-15T09:23:23.737Z","user":"blt07c2db602bb1f752","version":1}]},"modular_blocks_bottom":[],"modular_blocks_top":[],"product_category":[{"selectedIds":["7d6cbc5d-e3d8-4586-94b8-2f8809bccf96"],"items":[{"id":"7d6cbc5d-e3d8-4586-94b8-2f8809bccf96","name":"Ropa","image":"https://wtxrbu